gory-tag\">AI CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/ElarineNycanis/Citizen-Agent\" target=\"_blank\">Citizen-Agent</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Open-source AI terminal assistant with dynamic model switching, built-in vision understanding, AI image generation, music playback, and 5 parallel sub-agents.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 17</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Multi-Model CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/MemTensor/memmy-agent\" target=\"_blank\">MemTensor</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Personal AI agent & local memory hub for all AI agents. Gives every AI one shared, fully controlled memory and persistent context.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 16</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Memory Hub</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/bbarit/bb