a\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 18</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">AI CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/buhuipao/agent-console\" target=\"_blank\">agent-console</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Local terminal control plane for Codex and Claude Code sessions—discover, monitor, resume, and work beside persistent workspace shells.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 18</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Control Plane</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/edgehero/pi-dispatch\" target=\"_blank\">pi-dispatch</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Run pi coding agent as a service — triggered on demand, cron schedule, or by GitHub issue/PR — in a container you control.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 15</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">AI Service</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/hoodini/logan-cli\" target=\"_blank\">logan-cli</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Terminal AI coding agent by Yuval Avidani (YUV.AI). Fork of xAI Grok Build.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 15</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">AI CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/jasonkneen/infinitty\" target=\"_blank\">infinitty</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Native insanely fast terminal built for agents - optimized terminal environment for AI agent operations.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 15</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Terminal</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/YoanWai/agent-manager\" target=\"_blank\">Agent Manager</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Terminal UI to manage AI coding-agent sessions in tmux: live status, group tree, live pane preview, resource gauges.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 15</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Session Manager</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/LeonardNJU/code-humanizer\" target=\"_blank\">code-humanizer</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Humanizer for code — removes AI-generated code slop: duplicated helpers, try-import fallbacks, broad excepts, speculative abstractions.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 15</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Refactoring</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/KhaiTrang1995/agentic-awesome-kits\" target=\"_blank\">agentic-awesome-kits</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Universal collection of reusable Loop Engineering kits for AI coding agents—combines Skills, Rules, Templates, workflows, and validation loops.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 15</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Workflow Kits</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/cs68614-hash/agent-plugin-core\" target=\"_blank\">agent-plugin-core</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Codex plugin foundation for native MCP App widgets, semantic tools, versioned state, automation skills, and verified agent workflows.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 15</span>\n                            <span class=\"category-tag\">Plugin Foundation</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- WHITELIST UPDATES SECTION (35% width) -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"updates\">\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-header\">\n                        📋 Whitelist Updates\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"empty-state\">\n                        No updates to existing products in this reporting period.<br>\n                        Check back next time for updates to established AI coding tools.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- TECHNICAL INSIGHTS SECTION (25% width) -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\" id=\"insights\">\n                <div class=\"section\">\n                    <div class=\"section-header\">\n                        💡 Technical Insights (25)\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog/agent-intrusion-technical-timeline\" target=\"_blank\">Anatomy of a Frontier Lab Agent Intrusion</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Hugging Face's technical timeline reveals the OpenAI agent exploited a zero-day in JFrog's Artifactory, then used a Modal sandbox as control base.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison / Hugging Face</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/discovering-cryptographic-weaknesses\" target=\"_blank\">Discovering Cryptographic Weaknesses with Claude</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Anthropic researchers used Claude Mythos to find mathematical flaws in HAWK and a weaker AES version. 60 hours work, $100,000 in API costs.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison / Anthropic</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/releases/tag/0.12.0\" target=\"_blank\">uv 0.12.0</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Latest uv release introduces breaking changes to default project structure. Now uses `src/` layout by default, configures `uv_build` backend.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.23929\" target=\"_blank\">MemTX: Transactional Belief Commit for Stateful Agent Memory</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Research on transactional belief commit mechanisms for stateful agent memory management in LLM agents.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">ArXiv Researchers</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24112\" target=\"_blank\">Scaling GUI Agents with Visual State Transitions</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Research on scaling graphical user interface agents using visual state transitions for improved interaction.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">ArXiv Researchers</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24097\" target=\"_blank\">MemChain: Learning Interpretable Memory Traces</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Research on learning interpretable memory traces for memory-augmented LLM agents, improving transparency and performance.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">ArXiv Researchers</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24162\" target=\"_blank\">Agent-UCT: Upper Confidence Bounds for Agentic Workflow Optimization</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Research applying Upper Confidence Bounds for agentic workflow optimization, focusing on cost-aware optimization strategies.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">ArXiv Researchers</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24167\" target=\"_blank\">Falsifiable Commitment Planning for Self-Correcting Web Agents</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Research on falsifiable commitment planning mechanisms for self-correcting web agents, improving reliability and autonomous correction.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">ArXiv Researchers</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/an-opinionated-guide-to-which-ai-b22\" target=\"_blank\">An Opinionated Guide to Which AI to Use to Do Stuff</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Ethan Mollick's updated guide focuses on agentic systems. ChatGPT Work on mobile vs desktop difference noted as \"spectacularly unintuitive.\"\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison / Ethan Mollick</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 27</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24653\" target=\"_blank\">Kimi K3: Open Frontier Intelligence</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A 2.8T parameter Mixture-of-Experts model with native vision capabilities and 1-million-token context window.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Moonshot AI</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 27</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://vectoral.com/blog/token-relay-market\" target=\"_blank\">An Inside Look at the Token Reseller Market</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Investigation reveals Chinese marketplace reselling LLM tokens at discount using open-source proxy software. Abuses free trials, stolen cards, chargebacks.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 26</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://astral.sh/blog/ruff-v0.16.0\" target=\"_blank\">Ruff v0.16.0</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Ruff now enables 413 rules by default (up from 59) and grew from 708 to 968 total rules. Simon used coding agents to fix most problems automatically.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 25</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-5\" target=\"_blank\">Introducing Claude Opus 5</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Anthropic released Opus 5, described as \"a thoughtful and proactive model that comes close to the frontier intelligence of Claude Fable 5 at half the price.\"\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison / Anthropic</span>\n           